  "description": "CR 115.1, 601.2c, 120.3c, 120.3e, 121.1, 701.9a, 701.9b: Broadside Barrage deals 5 damage to target creature or planeswalker (marked damage on a creature, loyalty counters removed from a planeswalker), then its controller draws a card and discards a card of their choice; an Island and a player are no target",
